{
  "manifest": "1",
  "id": "lib.autolabel.align",
  "version": "1",
  "kind": "registry",
  "title": "数据类型 ↔ 模型对齐表（出厂）",
  "description": "每个 purpose（label / keyword）一张表；用户改动写 .configs/autolabel.align.json",
  "items": [
    {
      "key": "label/IMAGE",
      "purpose": "label",
      "datatype": "IMAGE",
      "template": "qwen2.5-1.5b-instruct-gguf",
      "align_template": "blip-image-captioning-base",
      "note": "先用图像描述模型把图片转成文字，再让对话模型生成标签"
    },
    {
      "key": "label/VIDEO",
      "purpose": "label",
      "datatype": "VIDEO",
      "template": "qwen2.5-1.5b-instruct-gguf",
      "align_template": "clip-vit-base-patch32",
      "note": "视频按画面做向量对齐（CLIP 只出向量、不参与提示词；抽帧还需要额外解码器，当下不生成文字描述）"
    },
    {
      "key": "label/AUDIO",
      "purpose": "label",
      "datatype": "AUDIO",
      "template": "qwen2.5-1.5b-instruct-gguf",
      "align_template": "whisper-base",
      "note": "先用语音识别把音频转成文字，再让对话模型生成标签"
    },
    {
      "key": "label/DOCUMENT",
      "purpose": "label",
      "datatype": "DOCUMENT",
      "template": "qwen2.5-1.5b-instruct-gguf",
      "note": "先用轻量向量模型把正文压成向量（取最相关的片段），再让对话模型生成标签",
      "align_template": "all-minilm-l6-v2"
    },
    {
      "key": "label/SPREADSHEET",
      "purpose": "label",
      "datatype": "SPREADSHEET",
      "template": "qwen2.5-1.5b-instruct-gguf",
      "note": "先用轻量向量模型把表格内容压成向量，再让对话模型生成标签",
      "align_template": "all-minilm-l6-v2"
    },
    {
      "key": "label/PRESENTATION",
      "purpose": "label",
      "datatype": "PRESENTATION",
      "template": "qwen2.5-1.5b-instruct-gguf",
      "note": "先用轻量向量模型把幻灯片文字压成向量，再让对话模型生成标签",
      "align_template": "all-minilm-l6-v2"
    },
    {
      "key": "label/ARCHIVE",
      "purpose": "label",
      "datatype": "ARCHIVE",
      "template": "qwen2.5-1.5b-instruct-gguf",
      "note": "压缩包按文件名 / 清单做向量对齐，再让对话模型生成标签",
      "align_template": "all-minilm-l6-v2"
    },
    {
      "key": "label/CODE",
      "purpose": "label",
